      <h2>Packing and unpacking done properly, so you don't have to</h2>
      <p>Packing a family home is a bigger job than most people expect, and the heavy lifting is only part of it. Fragile items, paperwork, medication, sentimental belongings and everyday essentials all need handling differently. Chayce Properties packs room by room, labels every box by destination room and keeps essentials accessible so that nothing important is lost in the move.</p>
      <p>Unpacking matters just as much. Depending on your package, we unpack, put belongings where you want them, reassemble furniture, make the beds and set the new home up so that it feels like yours from the first day, rather than leaving you surrounded by boxes.</p>
      <p>Packing and removals are included from &pound;995 with Bronze Essentials. Silver Comfort, from &pound;1,850, adds declutter support, a deep clean of the property you are leaving and full unpacking, with one coordinator managing the whole job. We are based in Northampton and work across the UK.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>You choose what is packed, what is kept out and what stays behind. Nothing is thrown away or donated without your say-so.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

