<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Do you offer a packing and unpacking service for older people?</summary><p>Yes. Packing is included from Bronze Essentials at &pound;995, and unpacking and setting up the new home is included from Silver Comfort at &pound;1,850.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does it take to pack a house?</summary><p>It depends on the size of the property and how much has been sorted. A typical family home takes a team a few days, which is why we plan the timeline with you at the Discovery Consultation.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will you label the boxes?</summary><p>Yes. Boxes are labelled by destination room so they can be placed correctly in the new home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I keep some things out until moving day?</summary><p>Yes. We keep essentials such as medication, important papers and everyday items accessible, and pack around you.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you pack fragile and sentimental items?</summary><p>Yes. Fragile and sentimental items are packed with extra care, and we never rush decisions about what to keep.</p></details>
    </div>
